              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huwo niko, BWANA orewikirieghe Waisraeli ituku jija kufuma kwa Wamisri, nawo wikawona gharia ra Wamisri pwani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.30",
