              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli wikawona kazi mbaa iyo BWANA oreibonyereghe kwa kuwisima Wamisri, nawo wikamuobua BWANA; wikamrumiria BWANA na mdumiki wake Musa.",
